menu "ECU bench trigger profile"
    config ECU_TRIGGER_SLOTS
        int "Total wheel slots, including missing teeth"
        range 12 120
        default 60
        help
            Incoming Hall test-wheel geometry. This does not enable engine outputs.

    config ECU_TRIGGER_MISSING
        int "Consecutive missing teeth"
        range 1 3
        default 2
        help
            Must also be less than one quarter of total slots. Invalid combinations
            leave the decoder invalid and inhibit the bench supervisor.

    config ECU_CAPTURE_MAX_RPM
        int "Maximum accepted capture speed, RPM"
        range 500 12000
        default 8000
        help
            Decoder input filter ceiling, not an engine rev-limit calibration.
endmenu
